       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CONTROL-TEST.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 COUNTER-A PIC 9 VALUE 0.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-PROCEDURE.
           PERFORM HIT WITH TEST AFTER UNTIL COUNTER-A = 0.
           PERFORM HIT WITH TEST BEFORE UNTIL COUNTER-A = 0.
           EVALUATE 5
             WHEN ANY DISPLAY "ANY"
           END-EVALUATE.
           DISPLAY "DONE".
           DISPLAY "??/??=??'".
           STOP RUN.
       HIT.
           DISPLAY "HIT".
       END PROGRAM CONTROL-TEST.
